sequenceDiagram
actor Farmer as Farmer
participant MobileUploadPage as Boundary: MobileUploadPage
participant UploadValidationControl as Control: UploadValidationControl
participant ImageFile as Entity: ImageFile
Farmer->>+MobileUploadPage: Select and prepare image
MobileUploadPage->>+UploadValidationControl: Upload with progress
UploadValidationControl->>+ImageFile: Validate MIME, bytes and pixels
ImageFile-->>-UploadValidationControl: Persist UUID and encrypted data
UploadValidationControl-->>-MobileUploadPage: Return image identifier
MobileUploadPage-->>-Farmer: Show completion or retry
